# ── Generated pipeline outputs (rebuild with `make all`) ──────────────────
# Every stage writes to its own `out/` folder; curated copies of the
# results live in `deliverables/` and full-resolution binaries are published
# as GitHub Release assets.
prototype/*/out/
runs/

